WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:02.854
Narrator: Step two, the keyboard on its own.

2
00:00:02.854 --> 00:00:07.430
Narrator: No screen reader and no mouse, just the keys a keyboard user presses,

3
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.149
Narrator: and the focus ring that shows where I am.

4
00:00:10.768 --> 00:00:12.597
Keyboard: Tab → link, Skip to content

5
00:00:12.597 --> 00:00:14.424
Narrator: The first stop is a skip link.

6
00:00:14.424 --> 00:00:18.748
Narrator: I'll press Return, then Tab, to see whether it really skips the header.

7
00:00:19.392 --> 00:00:21.448
Keyboard: Return → main

8
00:00:21.448 --> 00:00:23.282
Keyboard: Tab → link, Read the writing

9
00:00:23.282 --> 00:00:27.478
Narrator: I'm on Read the writing, past the whole header. The skip link works.

10
00:00:27.478 --> 00:00:29.206
Narrator: Now back up, with Shift-Tab.

11
00:00:29.827 --> 00:00:31.900
Keyboard: Shift-Tab → button, Pause motion

12
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.729
Keyboard: Shift-Tab → button, Set for you, collapsed

13
00:00:33.729 --> 00:00:38.400
Narrator: Pause motion, then Set for you: the same order as on screen,

14
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.359
Narrator: and the focus ring follows every time.

15
00:00:41.359 --> 00:00:45.954
Narrator: That's WCAG 2.4.7, Focus Visible. I'll open it with Return.

16
00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:48.647
Keyboard: Return → button, Set for you, expanded

17
00:00:48.647 --> 00:00:50.461
Keyboard: Tab → pop-up button, Drawings, in calm color

18
00:00:50.461 --> 00:00:54.453
Narrator: It opens, and Tab takes me to the first setting, the drawings.

19
00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:59.862
Narrator: With a dropdown focused, I can type the first letter of a choice. N, for not at all.

20
00:01:00.466 --> 00:01:02.856
Keyboard: Typed n

21
00:01:02.856 --> 00:01:04.355
Keyboard: Focus is on → pop-up button, Drawings, not at all

22
00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:07.222
Narrator: The dropdown says not at all, and the drawings are gone.

23
00:01:07.222 --> 00:01:10.130
Narrator: The setting changed without a mouse. Now Escape.

24
00:01:10.753 --> 00:01:12.597
Keyboard: Escape → button, Set for you, collapsed

25
00:01:12.597 --> 00:01:16.659
Narrator: Escape closes the panel, and puts focus back on the button.

26
00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:20.722
Narrator: Focus isn't trapped, and it isn't lost. Next, Pause motion.

27
00:01:21.345 --> 00:01:23.412
Keyboard: Tab → button, Pause motion

28
00:01:23.412 --> 00:01:25.185
Keyboard: Space → button, Pause motion, pressed

29
00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:28.335
Narrator: Space presses it, and the button now says pressed.

30
00:01:28.737 --> 00:01:33.077
Narrator: Tab, Shift-Tab, Return, Escape, Space, and typing to choose.

31
00:01:33.077 --> 00:01:36.188
Narrator: Every control I used works without a mouse,

32
00:01:36.188 --> 00:01:39.877
Narrator: and the focus ring showed me where I was each time.

33
00:01:39.877 --> 00:01:45.737
Narrator: For what I tested, the goal of step two is met. WCAG 2.1.1, Keyboard, holds here.
